--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c64463a8cfb05004786c9d008fce7188, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: Ichira
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48a6d4e800ab44d5e1c36d67b7f7b6b9, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    text: "L\xE2u l\u1EAFm m\u1EDBi th\u1EA5y anh Fuji gh\xE9 ti\u1EC7m. \xC2m nh\u1EA1c
      d\u1EA1o n\xE0y th\u1EBF n\xE0o r\u1ED3i anh?"
  - speakerName: Fuji
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48a6d4e800ab44d5e1c36d67b7f7b6b9, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    text: "V\u1EABn v\u1EADy th\xF4i c\xF4 Ichira \u1EA1. T\xF4i v\u1EABn y\xEAu
      t\u1EEBng n\u1ED1t nh\u1EA1c, v\u1EABn mu\u1ED1n c\u1ED1ng hi\u1EBFn h\u1EBFt
      m\xECnh cho ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt... nh\u01B0ng ng\u1EB7t n\u1ED7i gia \u0111\xECnh
      l\u1EA1i ph\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED1i d\u1EEF d\u1ED9i qu\xE1. Nhi\u1EC1u l\xFAc
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111i tr\xEAn con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\xE0y, t\xF4i th\u1EA5y
      c\xF4 \u0111\u1ED9c v\xF4 c\xF9ng."
  - speakerName: Ichira
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48a6d4e800ab44d5e1c36d67b7f7b6b9, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng theo \u0111u\u1ED5i \u0111am m\xEA ch\u01B0a
      bao gi\u1EDD l\xE0 d\u1EC5 d\xE0ng, nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 khi thi\u1EBFu \u0111i
      s\u1EF1 \u1EE7ng h\u1ED9 t\u1EEB ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\xE2n. Nh\u01B0ng anh kh\xF4ng
      \u0111\u01A1n \u0111\u1ED9c \u0111\xE2u, \xE2m nh\u1EA1c c\u1EE7a anh lu\xF4n
      c\xF3 nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng l\u1EAFng nghe. "
  - speakerName: Fuji
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48a6d4e800ab44d5e1c36d67b7f7b6b9, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    text: "C\xF4 n\xF3i l\xE0m t\xF4i th\u1EA5y \u1EA5m l\xF2ng h\u01A1n \u0111\u1EA5y."
